=2 Walkthrough
* As seen in the previous cutscene, you are asked to bring ONE of the following items to Guilberien.
** {i:Eft Skin|Eft Skin|1623} (x5)
** {i:Manticore Hair|Manticore Hair|1163} (x4)
** {i:Buffalo Horn|Buffalo Horn|1615}
** {i:Manticore Leather}
** {i:Buffalo Leather|Buffalo Leather|1629}
* The specific item asked for depends on the level of your bond with Arciela, with {i:Buffalo Horn|Buffalo Horn|1615} indicating the lowest level.[1]
* Trade the requested item(s) to the **Port Storage** door to complete this mission.

